> > make snd_hda_jack_detect_enable_callback() returning the pointer while
> > handling the error with the standard IS_ERR() & co.
> >
> > Signed-off-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>
> > ---
> >   sound/pci/hda/hda_jack.c       | 20 +++++++++++++-------
